        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You think you can beat me? Ridiculous."
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, Hisami!"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hup!"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Lady Zanmu!",
                "What are we doing?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I shall be taking my leave, but only for a moment."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Of course! Please enjoy your trip!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<b$Hey>, have you already forgotten how Hell works?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, you mean killing anyone who tries to leave!",
                "Right away!"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Of course, don't forget that!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's why I'll be leaving it to you."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Should anyone visit here,",
                "you're free to do what you wish to them."
            ]
        },
        "80_0": {
            "lines": [
                "..."
            ]
        },
        "88_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Forgive me, Lady Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "96_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But from now on, I'll be following Miss Suika's advice",
                "and get you to scold me."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes, I killed you!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Matriarch of the Keiga Family, Saki Kurokoma!",
                "Show yourself!"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? Wha?"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "La-Lady Zanmu!?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I never thought you'd walk out of Hell.",
                "What might you be doing today?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Most of the surface's land ownership ",
                "has been distributed."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You beasts' jobs are done."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Playtime's over.",
                "Return to the Animal Realm!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You gained me an ally, gave me strict advice,",
                "I thought we're about to kick up our partnership."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is this really the end between us?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, I'm sorry that I toyed with you."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll remember the deeds of the Keiga Family."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Join me later at the celebration feast."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm honored to receive that gratitude."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Phew. Your jokes were tough, my ma'am."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Matriarch of the Gouyoku Alliance, Yuuma Toutetsu!",
                "Show yourself!"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? What?"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, well. Aren't you Zan... I mean Lady Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "|\t\t,\tThe Former Hell of Blood Pools\t,Place like this",
                "The Former Hell of Blood Pools was cut off by your reform.",
                "What're you even here for?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Most of the surface's land ownership ",
                "has been distributed."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your beasts' jobs are done."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Playtime's over.",
                "Stop the violence on the surface at once!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What do you mean it's done?",
                "Screw you."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What happens to Chiyari then?",
                "She's 'your' spy!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Chiyari did a good job,",
                "so she has already taken her day off."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "None of you had any free will",
                "from the start."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll remember the deeds of the Gouyoku Alliance."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Join me later at the celebration feast."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That just sounds stupid. I'm out."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You won, you won!",
                "I surrender!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Matriarch of the Kiketsu Family, Yachie Kicchou!",
                "Show yourself!"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? What?"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Lady Zanmu!",
                "What brings you to the Animal Realm?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you had contacted me in advance,",
                "I would have prepared to welcome you."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't need your hospitality."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Most of the surface's land ownership ",
                "has been distributed."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You beasts' jobs are done."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Playtime's over.",
                "Stop the violence on the surface at once!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's... over."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see what you mean..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It hasn't been so long since we met,",
                "and you've already grown so timid."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Yachie Kicchou that I know",
                "is not supposed be like this."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You were intelligent. You feared no consequences.",
                "And above all, you were unbelievably energetic."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're right.",
                "I... I was not being myself."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Join me at the celebration feast later.",
                "You will come, yes?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heheheh.",
                "I'll look forward to that!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's far from over,"
                "isn't it?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The beasts must have already lost ",
                "their fighting spirit."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's only a matter of time before the ",
                "beast spirits leave the surface."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All that's left is to go back",
                "and wait for time to pass."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I appreciate your efforts."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you have fun greeting all the beasts?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah?",
                "Suika? How come?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is there something wrong",
                "with me being here?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's all in your palm, isn't it?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "..."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, no, there's nothing wrong with that."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let me congratulate you, too,",
                "on solving the incident!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you up to?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's no purpose for you to",
                "watch for me in this place."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's also too unlikely to be a coincidence."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's a bad habit of yours,",
                "thinking that everything has a purpose."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I just wanted to be invited to the feast."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Bye now."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "An oni always focuses on the fight no matter what happens.",
                "Put your oni face on!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...That Hisami,",
                "she's done it now."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I told her not to let anyone in ",
                "while I was gone."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmm? I see!",
                "So that's how it is."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heh heh heh..."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you laughing at?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you were talking about that Hell's guide,",
                "she led me here with no hesitation."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So Reimu was the one who was hiding."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmph, this was Suika's doing right?",
                "Both you and Hisami."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well. I was planning to call you over anyway, Reimu."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Everything's proceeding as planned."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Call me over?",
                "For what?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's simple."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fight me, and defeat me."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?",
                "What's that about?"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"The incident in Gensokyo just solved itself.\""
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That won't ease the people's fears.",
                "It won't amount to true incident resolution."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"The shrine maiden fixed everything by defeating the mastermind, Zanmu.\"",
                "Render it that way."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't really get it,",
                "but apparently this is my last job."
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That alone will stabilize Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll give you the credit for resolving the incident.",
                "You'll take it, won't you?"
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmph. No, thanks."
            ]
        },
        "288_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I know what your true plans are!"
            ]
        },
        "296_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Zanmu, you...! You want to leave your shadow in",
                "everyone who's involved in the incident!"
            ]
        },
        "304_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even if I take the credit for resolving the incident,",
                "your shadow will always remain in my heart."
            ]
        },
        "312_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I want no part of that!"
            ]
        },
        "320_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Augh, Suika must've hinted you."
            ]
        },
        "336_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Instead, I will strike the true terror of oni into your heart!"
            ]
        },
        "328_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you plan to escape from my palm now,",
                "I no longer need to purposefully lose."
            ]
        },
        "344_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let that terror be carved to the ends of your imagination!",
                "Human of many futures!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? Even if I win, it won't end? What's the deal?"
            ]
        }
    }
}